<title>MALAYSIA: PDZ stock suspended pending announcement.</title>
<headline>PDZ stock suspended pending announcement.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian shipping company PDZ Holdings Bhd's stock was suspended on Friday pending a company announcement.</p>
<p>The company requested the suspension in a statement to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>A company official said PDZ would be making an announcement by either Monday or Tuesday, but did not give any more details.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
